  message: "Tag cleanup (2026-04-17): removed `cross_language_linkers` tag — this item is specifically about the governance-file edits that restore the **four-subcategory** vocabulary (Protocol / Bridge / Framework / Infrastructure), not about cross-language linkers specifically. Tags `governance` and `analysis_quality` remain.\n\nAlso: the \"Line 5 priority #3\" / \"Line 6 priority #4\" / \"Line 10 priority #7\" / \"line 31, 34, 64, 67\" line-number citations in the description are fragile — the bakeoff playbooks and AGENTS.md have been edited multiple times since this item was filed. Before opening the PR after approval, I'll re-locate the target strings by content (grep for 'polyglot repos are common' / 'Ensure comprehensive linker, framework' / etc.) rather than by line number."  # d1e0
